{{also|Dinsdag}}
==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|dinsendach}}. Probably from {{der|dum|gem-pro|*þingsus-dagaz}} "Day of Thingsus". 

{{m|la|Thingsus}}, {{m|ang|Tiw}} or {{m|non|Týr}} was the name of the Germanic god of justice. 

Compare Low German {{m|nds-de|Dingsdag}} and German {{m|de|Dienstag}}.

